error[E0443]: closure captures 'base' before it is assigned
 --> $DIR/last-captured-early.nra:4:33
  |
3 |     last base: int;
  |          ---- declared here without a value
4 |     let read = func() -> int => base;
  |                                 ^^^^ 'base' is captured here
  |                ---- the closure is created here, before 'base' is assigned
  |
  = note: a closure copies the values it captures when it is created
  = help: assign 'base' before creating the closure

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0443`.
